 cards

Extend DeviceInfo with brand, branch, player device id, category,
installed APK version, and last schedule sync date. Fetch values via
adb run-as sqlite query and dumpsys package, and update the devices UI.

Co-authored-by: admin <admin@ultron-ad.com>
